    "displayName": "The Mad Slayer",
    "header": [
      {
        "name": "quest",
        "value": "R0C11Y28"
      },
      {
        "name": "displayname",
        "value": "The Mad Slayer"
      }
    ],
    "messages": [
      {
        "id": 1000,
        "firstLine": 13,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>               There's a nightmare stalking the streets",
          "<ce>                    of ___bookstore_. They're calling him the",
          "<ce>                       ___bookstore_ Slayer, and so far no",
          "<ce>               one can tell me if he's a man or a beast.",
          "<ce>                  One of my finest sages, _contact_,",
          "<ce>               is examing the bodies of the victims, but",
          "<ce>                %g has begun getting disturbing letters",
          "<ce>                and frankly fears for %g3 life. I need",
          "<ce>              someone to investigate %g3 findings to see",
          "<ce>               if %g3 fears are justified. Will you help",
          "<ce>                    me in this, %pcf? I will offer",
          "<ce>              you _reward_ gold pieces in return for the",
          "<ce>                     retirement of the ___bookstore_ Slayer."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1001,
        "firstLine": 28,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                 Not an uncommon response. Then I have",
          "<ce>                 little choice, but to call on some of",
          "<ce>                 my less-savoury contacts for help --",
          "<ce>                   an option I was hoping to avoid."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1002,
        "firstLine": 34,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                      Thank %god for that, anyway.",
          "<ce>                    The people of %reg are becoming",
          "<ce>               anxious about the lack of progress in the",
          "<ce>                official investigations. I fear that we",
          "<ce>                will have a mob situation soon, perhaps",
          "<ce>                  in =total_ days or less. _contact_",
          "<ce>                       works out of _bookstore_,",
          "<ce>                 and I told %g2 I'd be sending someone",
          "<ce>                  there soon. Watch out for yourself,",
          "<ce>                     %pcf. Until this situation is",
          "<ce>                    resolved, remember that the ___bookstore_",
          "<ce>                          night has a knife."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1003,
        "firstLine": 48,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                        The ___bookstore_ Slayer is still",
          "<ce>                at large. I have no time for chatting,",
          "<ce>                            nor should you."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1004,
        "firstLine": 53,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                     %reg is at peace again, %pcf,",
          "<ce>          thanks to you. Here is the _reward_ gold I promised",
          "<ce>             -- gladly will I give it for the end of that",
          "<ce>              maniac and your discretion in this matter.",
          "<ce>                    %god truly blessed us when you",
          "<ce>                             came to %reg."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1005,
        "firstLine": 61,
        "lines": [
          "It isn't safe to walk the streets of ___bookstore_ anymore. Not with the ___bookstore_ Slayer.",
          "<--->",
          "I hear the Slayer isn't a man at all, but a daedra come to punish us all.",
          "<--->",
          "The last victim of the ___bookstore_ Slayer was found scattered in pieces over ___bookstore_.",
          "<--->",
          "Some folks are wondering if the Slayer might be a vampire or a werewolf."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1006,
        "firstLine": 70,
        "lines": [
          "The killings stopped without us needing a mob. Guess the Slayer moved on.",
          "<--->",
          "_qgiver_'s just lucky the ___bookstore_ Slayer decided to move on. Panic was setting in.",
          "<--->",
          "_qgiver_ is still anxious. You'd think the Slayer's absence would relieve %g2.",
          "<--->",
          "The ___bookstore_ Slayer disappeared just as suddenly as he came to ___bookstore_.",
          "<--->",
          "Some say the Slayer's still here, waiting for the stars to be right again."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1007,
        "firstLine": 81,
        "lines": [
          "I'm still afraid to be out in ___bookstore_ alone, even with the Slayer supposedly dead.",
          "<--->",
          "Guess the ___bookstore_ Slayer was just some poor lunatic. Nothing romantic to him at all.",
          "<--->",
          "The newest rumor is that the ___bookstore_ Slayer wasn't a vampire, but thought he was."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1008,
        "firstLine": 88,
        "lines": [
          "I still remember you, %pcf, and the discretion you showed with the ___bookstore_ Slayer."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1009,
        "firstLine": 91,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                    You failed me in the ___bookstore_ Slayer",
          "<ce>                         affair, %pcf. I don't",
          "<ce>                  see any reason to believe you won't",
          "<ce>                            fail me again."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1010,
        "firstLine": 97,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                        Ah, %pcf, my dear %ra,",
          "<ce>                I am very glad you've arrived. You have",
          "<ce>              doubtless been told that I've become a bit",
          "<ce>               of a hermit ever since I began receiving",
          "<ce>                those letters threatening my life if I",
          "<ce>               did not abandon my investigations. Well,",
          "<ce>               now I have an old colleague in town with",
          "<ce>                whose assistance I may be able to solve",
          "<ce>               these murders. I would like you to bring",
          "<ce>                       these notes to a _vamp_,",
          "<ce>                       a =vamp_ you will find at",
          "<ce>                      _hookerhouse_. If anything",
          "<ce>               should happen to me, I want someone to be",
          "<ce>              able to continue on in the investigations.",
          "<ce>                        That will be _vamp_ and",
          "<ce>                   you, %pcf. So don't get yourself",
          "<ce>                           killed out there."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1011,
        "firstLine": 116,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_,",
          " ",
          " Terminate your investigations of the %reg Slayer's",
          " victims if you value your life. You are moving",
          " blindly into an inferno.",
          " ",
          " If you continue, you will die before your",
          " studies are finished. Consider this a",
          " serious warning.",
          " ",
          "<ce>                             A Well-Wisher"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1012,
        "firstLine": 129,
        "lines": [
          "Dear _contact_,",
          " ",
          " Even if you lock all your doors and extinguish",
          " all light from _bookstore_, we",
          " will know that you are still indulging in your",
          " forbidden autopsies. Do not ask for us to",
          " demonstrate our power to stop you, for we will",
          " act but once.",
          " ",
          "<ce>                             A Well-Wisher"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1013,
        "firstLine": 141,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_,",
          " ",
          " I would very much like to meet with you",
          " about your fascinating mortuary studies of",
          " the Slayer victims. As you know, I have",
          " done similar investigations and would be",
          " happy to share my knowledge and experience",
          " with a distinguished colleague.",
          " ",
          " Let me know by courier how it would be",
          " most convenient for us to meet. I am",
          " staying at _hookerhouse_,",
          " but perhaps you would rather meet at",
          " _bookstore_ so I might",
          " see the corpses in question. In either",
          " case I look forward to receiving your",
          " courier and note.",
          " ",
          "<ce>                         Yours in admiration,",
          " ",
          "<ce>                                _vamp_"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1014,
        "firstLine": 164,
        "lines": [
          "Autopsy report for %fn:",
          " ",
          " Throat torn out, apparently",
          " with violent force (Slayer a",
          " madman? Check into Lobornus'",
          " work with criminally insane in Agryn",
          " Prison). Death instantaneous,",
          " no sign of struggle (Slayer knew",
          " victim? Did not appear a threat?)",
          " Carotid artery completely severed,",
          " loss of blood extensive by time of",
          " examination (remember to ask",
          " _qgiver_ to send over guards",
          " who found body for interview).",
          " ",
          " Autopsy report for %mn:",
          " ",
          " Subject shows similar pathology to",
          " female victim. Throat torn out violently,",
          " bruises on upper arms as if gripped by",
          " extremely strong man (Slayer's insanity",
          " produces superhuman strength? Note to self:",
          " write to Lobornus for research notes from",
          " interesting case he reported at last year's",
          " Conclave). Bruising indicates some time",
          " between attack and death? (Could be unrelated",
          " to attack? Check on background of victim)."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1015,
        "firstLine": 193,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                    So, for all the days _contact_",
          "<ce>                has spent with those flyblown cadavers",
          "<ce>                         all %g comes up with",
          "<ce>                     is this. %god, with this as a",
          "<ce>                      start, _contact_ won't get",
          "<ce>                an intimation of the Slayer's identity",
          "<ce>                     for weeks yet. Listen, %pcf,",
          "<ce>                     if you want to help _qgiver_,",
          "<ce>                   take this flower over to _widow_",
          "<ce>                        in _widowhouse_ -- %g3",
          "<ce>                        brother was %mn, one of",
          "<ce>                  the Slayer's victims. This may seem",
          "<ce>                 like a trivial sentimentality, but it",
          "<ce>                 will bring you closer to finding the",
          "<ce>                        ___bookstore_ Slayer than any of",
          "<ce>                        _contact_'s scientific",
          "<ce>                      catalyses. Trust me, %pcf."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1016,
        "firstLine": 212,
        "lines": [
          "_vamp_ is the =vamp_ I met over at _hookerhouse_. Nice enough, but spooky.",
          "<--->",
          "_vamp_ is the name of the =vamp_ staying over at _hookerhouse_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1017,
        "firstLine": 217,
        "lines": [
          "_vamp_ is one of the %vcn, sent to ___bookstore_ to eliminate the mad Slayer.",
          "<--->",
          "_vamp_ is a %vcn vampire here to stop the risk to %g3 security, the Slayer."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1018,
        "firstLine": 222,
        "lines": [
          "Poor _widow_ stays at _widowhouse_ ever since the Slayer got %g3 brother.",
          "<--->",
          "The %reg Slayer killed _widow_'s brother, and now %g never leaves _widowhouse_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1019,
        "firstLine": 227,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>               A red poppy? Oh, you must be my brother's",
          "<ce>                    friend, _rippername_, yes? I do",
          "<ce>             appreciate the comforting note you sent after",
          "<ce>             his death. He didn't have very many friends,",
          "<ce>            and, to tell the truth, he had never mentioned",
          "<ce>             your name. But I certainly thank you for the",
          "<ce>              lovely flowers and the invitation to visit",
          "<ce>                         you at _ripperhouse_.",
          "<ce>              I've always admired that place, and I would",
          "<ce>                     like to see the inside of it.",
          "<ce>                                    ",
          "<ce>                  What, you're not _rippername_? Oh,",
          "<ce>              I'm so sorry. Please forgive me, I haven't",
          "<ce>              been myself since my brother... No, I don't",
          "<ce>             think I have information that might help you",
          "<ce>              find that murdering devil. You know I would",
          "<ce>              help you if I could. But you will find the",
          "<ce>               fiend that killed my brother, won't you?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1020,
        "firstLine": 247,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " I am on the trail of the Slayer",
          " of ___bookstore_. The %rt wants",
          " the ___bookstore_ Slayer caught in =total_ days",
          " before the murders inflame the populace",
          " to riot. _qgiver_ has a scientist",
          " who has been examining the bodies of the",
          " Slayer's victims and has recently",
          " begun getting death threats, apparently",
          " from the Slayer. _contact_ is",
          " the name of this scientist, and %g",
          " works out of _bookstore_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1021,
        "firstLine": 261,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " _contact_ has sent me",
          " to _hookerhouse_ to meet with",
          " an old colleague named _vamp_,",
          " who might be able to help with the research."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1022,
        "firstLine": 268,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " I got to _bookstore_ too late.",
          " Apparently, _contact_'s death",
          " threats were very real. Among the letters",
          " I found was one from a colleague interested in",
          " meeting with _contact_, someone",
          " named _vamp_ staying at",
          " _hookerhouse_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1023,
        "firstLine": 278,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " I met with _vamp_ who seems",
          " less than impressed with %g3",
          " colleague _contact_'s work",
          " on the %reg Slayer victims.",
          " _vamp_ told me to bring",
          " a red poppy to someone named",
          " _widow_ whose brother",
          " was killed by the Slayer. I have some",
          " suspicions, but I won't know for sure",
          " until I go to _widowhouse_",
          " where _widow_ lives."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1024,
        "firstLine": 292,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " The late _contact_'s colleague",
          " and murderer are one and the same person.",
          " _vamp_ is a vampire, but professes",
          " not to be the Slayer. If I kill the person",
          " %g says is the %reg Slayer, _rippername_",
          " of _ripperhouse_, _vamp_",
          " has promised me a reward, apparently",
          " in addition to the reward I'd get",
          " from _qgiver_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1025,
        "firstLine": 304,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " _widow_, the =widow_",
          " _vamp_ sent me to, believed",
          " that I was someone named _rippername_.",
          " This _rippername_ apparently sent",
          " _widow_ a bouquet of red poppies",
          " and invited %g2 to a place called",
          " _ripperhouse_. Sounds like a Slayer",
          " trap if there ever was one."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1026,
        "firstLine": 315,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                 Which letter brought you to me, %pcn?",
          "<ce>             You are probably aware that I wrote them all.",
          "<ce>                      After _contact_ refused to",
          "<ce>           listen to my polite warnings about investigating",
          "<ce>            matters beyond mortal understanding, I invited",
          "<ce>             %g2 here as %g3 friend. I knew %g2, you see,",
          "<ce>             years ago, before I became a vampire. We met,",
          "<ce>                      went back to _bookstore_ to",
          "<ce>              see the bodies, and there I slew %g2. Quite",
          "<ce>             painlessly. I could tell %g would never have",
          "<ce>              halted his studies. More than that I cannot",
          "<ce>               say, except that the Slayer is a vampire",
          "<ce>               like myself, but mad from the blessing of",
          "<ce>                      immortality. _rippername_,",
          "<ce>             that's the Slayer's real name and %g lives at",
          "<ce>                    _ripperhouse_. If you go there",
          "<ce>            and slay %g2, I will reward you. If you intend",
          "<ce>                     to continue with _contact_'s",
          "<ce>              studies, I will have no choice but to kill",
          "<ce>                 you as well. That is my simple offer."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1027,
        "firstLine": 337,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_ is quite a learned scientist over in _bookstore_, %di of here.",
          "<--->",
          "_contact_ is a =contact_ who works out of _bookstore_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1028,
        "firstLine": 342,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_ is dissecting the Slayer's victims and someone doesn't like that.",
          "<--->",
          "_contact_'s a scientist at _bookstore_, who has been getting threat letters."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1029,
        "firstLine": 347,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>  The Mad Slayer is no more."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1050,
        "firstLine": 350,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                   By killing _rippername_, you have",
          "<ce>                 aided both %reg and myself. For this,",
          "<ce>                  I give you a _reward2_. Perhaps we",
          "<ce>                     may meet again one day, %pcn.",
          "<ce>                  You have intrigued me in our brief",
          "<ce>              acquaintance. May the night keep you safe."
        ]
      }
    ],
